{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "line-3",
      "text": "鉸掉頭鬃 面對新的一工",
      "spelling": "ka tiāu thâu-tsang  bīn-tuì sin ê tsi̍t kang",
      "source_lines": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-6",
      "text": "莫閣想昨日的心疼",
      "spelling": "mài koh siūnn tso̍h-ji̍t ê sim-thiànn",
      "source_lines": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-9",
      "text": "掠不定運命的變化",
      "spelling": "lia̍h buē-tiānn ūn-miā ê piàn-huà",
      "source_lines": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-12",
      "text": "忽然間失去希望",
      "spelling": "hut-liân kan sit-khì hi-bāng",
      "source_lines": [
        12,
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-15",
      "text": "我知影你的孤單",
      "spelling": "guá tsai-iánn lí ê koo-tuann",
      "source_lines": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-18",
      "text": "我知影你的驚惶",
      "spelling": "guá tsai-iánn lí ê kiann-hiânn",
      "source_lines": [
        18,
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-21",
      "text": "展開雙跤 大步大步行",
      "spelling": "thián-khui siang-kha tuā-pōo tuā-pōo kiânn",
      "source_lines": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-24",
      "text": "從今後袂閣再軟茈",
      "spelling": "tsiông kim-āu buē koh tsài nńg-tsiánn",
      "source_lines": [
        24,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-27",
      "text": "頭前是全新的性命",
      "spelling": "thâu-tsîng sī tsuân-sin ê sìnn-miā",
      "source_lines": [
        27,
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-30",
      "text": "共目屎拭予焦",
      "spelling": "kāng ba̍k-sái tshit hōo ta",
      "source_lines": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-33",
      "text": "過去就予伊過去",
      "spelling": "kuè-khì tio̍h hōo i kuè-khì",
      "source_lines": [
        33,
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-36",
      "text": "重新過生活",
      "spelling": "tiông-sin kuè sing-ua̍h",
      "source_lines": [
        36,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-39",
      "text": "我知影這袂輕鬆 頭前路崎崎嶇嶇",
      "spelling": "guá tsai-iánn tse bô khin-sang  thâu-tsîng lōo khí-khí-kiā-kiā",
      "source_lines": [
        39,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-42",
      "text": "這是你的人生",
      "spelling": "tse sī lí ê lîn-sing",
      "source_lines": [
        42,
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-45",
      "text": "有勇氣來選擇 有志氣來承擔",
      "spelling": "ū ióng-khì lâi suán-ti̍k  ū tsì-khì lâi sîng-tam",
      "source_lines": [
        45,
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-48",
      "text": "做勇敢的人",
      "spelling": "tsuè ióng-kám ê lâng",
      "source_lines": [
        48,
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-51",
      "text": "我知影這袂輕鬆 但未來猶原佇遐",
      "spelling": "guá tsai-iánn tse bô khin-sang  nā bī-lâi iu-guân tī hia",
      "source_lines": [
        51,
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-54",
      "text": "欲去就愛行",
      "spelling": "beh khì tio̍h ài kiânn",
      "source_lines": [
        54,
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-57",
      "text": "你的故事 你家己來寫",
      "spelling": "lí ê kòo-sū  lí ka-tī lâi siá",
      "source_lines": [
        57,
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-60",
      "text": "繼續向前行",
      "spelling": "kè-sio̍k hiòng-tsiân kiânn",
      "source_lines": [
        60,
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-63",
      "text": "有一天閣再失去氣力",
      "spelling": "ū tsi̍t kang koh-tsài sit-khì khuì-la̍t",
      "source_lines": [
        63,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-66",
      "text": "希望你想起這條歌",
      "spelling": "hi-bāng lí siūnn-khí tsit tiâu kua",
      "source_lines": [
        66,
        67
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-69",
      "text": "命運啊愈是戲弄 就愈唱愈大聲",
      "spelling": "miā-ūn ah lú sī hì lāng  tio̍h lú tshiùnn lú tuā-siann",
      "source_lines": [
        69,
        70
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-72",
      "text": "希望我的勇氣 陪你向前行",
      "spelling": "hi-bāng guá ê ióng-khì  puê lí hiòng-tsiân kiânn",
      "source_lines": [
        72,
        73
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-75",
      "text": "我知影這袂輕鬆 頭前路崎崎嶇嶇",
      "spelling": "guá tsai-iánn tse bô khin-sang  thâu-tsîng lōo khí-khí-kiā-kiā",
      "source_lines": [
